# Copy to .env.local for local dev, and set the same key in the Vercel project env.
#
# BUTTONDOWN_API_KEY — enables the homepage "The Vault" waitlist capture.
# Server-only (never exposed to the client). When unset, the homepage shows the
# honest "being built" teaser with no signup form. When set, the form renders and
# posts to /api/subscribe, which forwards to Buttondown with double opt-in.
# Get the key: Buttondown → Settings → Programming → API key.
BUTTONDOWN_API_KEY=
